~ greeting
$> Global.expression = "happy"
Val: hi!
if Global.val_meter <= Global.ONE_HEART:
	=>< one_heart
elif Global.val_meter <= Global.TWO_HEARTS:
	=> two_hearts
=> END
~ one_heart
%
	Val: I had a pomegranate for the first time yesterday!
	$> Global.expression = "elated"
	Val: it was really good - you should try one!
	$> Global.expression = "happy"
	Val: they're in season!
	$> Global.expression = "unsure"
	Val: I think...
	$> Global.expression = "surprised" 
	Val: I heard that from somewhere, I swear!
	- I've had one before
		$> Global.expression = "elated"
		Val: omg really!! [$> Global.val_meter += 2][$> Global.happiness += 2]
		Val: how was it? 
		- it was kinda gross
			$> Global.expression = "surprised" 
			Val: EHH, REALLY?
			$> Global.expression = "laugh" 
			Val: you just haven't had a good one then!
			$> Global.expression = "elated" 
			Val: ok, remind me to bring you one tomorrow
			$> Global.expression = "happy" 
			Val: the one's at my house right now are so good
		- it was delicious
			$> Global.expression = "elated" 
			Val: YAYYY, I KNOW RIGHT
	- this is really your first time having one?
		$> Global.expression = "angry" 
		Val: ...
		$> Global.expression = "surprised" 
		Val: AHH, DON'T JUDGE ME!! [$> Global.val_meter -= 2][$> Global.happiness += 5][$> Global.wrong += 1]
		$> Global.expression = "angry" 
		Val: it's - there's
		$> Global.expression = "surprised" 
		Val: THERE'S A FIRST TIME FOR EVERYTHING!!
		$> Global.expression = "unsure" 
		Val: I'm just letting you know 'cause it was so good
		$> Global.expression = "angry" 
		Val: damn, I didn't expect such judgement
		- chill, I wasn't judging you
			Val: suree... [$> Global.val_meter -= 5][$> Global.wrong += 1]
		- haha, sorry for judging you
			$> Global.expression = "unsure" 
			Val: ok... [$> Global.val_meter += 2]
	- ok, I'll try one
		$> Global.expression = "elated" 
		Val: YES [$> Global.val_meter += 2]
		Val: send me a pic of it when you do!
		$> Global.expression = "happy" 
		Val: make sure you get a good one too!
% 
	$> Global.expression = "unsure" 
	Val: ...
	Val: umm, how are you?
	- good
		$> Global.expression = "unsure" 
		Val: that's good... [$> Global.val_meter -= 2][$> Global.happiness -= 2][$> Global.wrong += 1]
		$> Global.expression = "unsure" 
		Val: I'm good too 
		
	- tired
		$> Global.expression = "happy" 
		Val: same! [$> Global.val_meter += 2][$> Global.happiness += 2]
		Val: it's just one more period tho!
		$> Global.expression = "laugh" 
		Val: STAY STRONG!

=> questions
=> END


~ two_hearts
	Val: AHH I have a test next period
	- did you study
		Val: ...
		Val: that's... irrelevant
		- well, 
			- you have no one to blame but yourself
				Val: AWW C'MON, I was really busy yesterday...
				Val: with... engaging in the wider world! in short form... 
				- you were doomscrolling, weren't you?
					Val: ...
					Val: AHH I thought I hid that welllll 
					Val: ok, fine you caught me
					
					- get your book out
						Val: yes ma'am 
					
				- ok? I'll take your word for it
					Val: yea...
					Val: thanks hehe
				
		- I can help you study... right now?
			- if you want?
				Val: no way! really?
				Val: you'd do that for me
				Val: wait, let me get my stuff out
				Val: thank you so much!
	- good luck! :)
		Val: thanks!!
		Val: ...I'm gonna need it haha
		Val:
=> END


~ questions
$> Global.expression = "happy" 
Val: ...
- compliment
	% => good
	%2 => bad
- joke 
	% => joke_good
	% => joke_bad
- open up [if Global.val_meter > Global.FOUR_HEARTS]
- end convo
=> END

~ good
Val: ...  [$> Global.val_meter += 4][$> Global.happiness += 2]
$> Global.expression = "sad" 
Val: aww, Violet
$> Global.expression = "surprised" 
Val: don't look - I'm blushing right now!!
=> bell
=> END

~ bad
Val: ... [$> Global.val_meter -= 4][$> Global.happiness -= 4][$> Global.wrong += 1]
$> Global.expression = "angry" 
Val: excuse me?
$> Global.expression = "unsure" 
Val: I'm gonna pretend I didn't hear that
=> bell
=> END

~ joke_good
Val: ...
$> Global.expression = "laugh" 
Val: HAHHHAHAHA [$> Global.val_meter += 2][$> Global.happiness += 2]
Val: Oh shoot, didn't mean to laugh that loud... haha
Val: if we get yelled at, it's your fault 
=> bell
=> END

~ joke_bad
Val: ...
$> Global.expression = "angry" 
Val: ?? [$> Global.val_meter -= 2][$> Global.happiness -= 2][$> Global.wrong += 1]
$> Global.expression = "unsure" 
Val: ohhhh, that's what you meant!
Val: bruh, that was so corny
Val: you can do better than that...
=> bell
=> END

~ bell
$> Global.expression = "unsure"
Val: ahh, ms is staring at us...
Val: let's lock in
=> END